  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6401.30 “Submitting agency” means a law enforcement agency within the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #8620, eff 5-1-06; ss by #9684, eff 3-23-10 (from Saf-C 6401.31); ss by #12526, eff 5-11-18 (from Saf-C 6401.29)",
